{
  "bookId": "rewind-28",
  "id": "chapter-108",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27005001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你们作为管理局的人，有帮助其他手办居民解决困境的义务吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "也不能说是义务，只能说，我们愿意提供更多的帮助。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "那就没错了，反正我，莉可大人，是来找你们帮忙的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "可恶，好嚣张。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "哈莉还是第一次见到有人这样寻求帮助的，不过，似乎挺有意思？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不要有意思啊，请快点忘掉，我们不需要更奇怪的哈莉了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "委托的事情，只要可以做到，我们当然可以帮忙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "但是在这之前，莉可你或许应该和我们解释下A区之前发生爆炸的事情？虽然没有伤到人，但是有不少手办受到了惊吓。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "这些细节先不要在意。我有更重要的事情要处理。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这不能不在意吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "总之，你们先帮忙处理下我的委托吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪，看来你带回来了一个麻烦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "唔，没办法，在路上遇到，又被这样可爱的孩子求助，实在没办法拒绝。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "说谁可爱呢！这叫威严。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "好的，莉可大人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "请问你想让我们帮忙做什么呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "这个家伙——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我希望你们能帮助他，找回他想要的东西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005020",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "唔啊啊啊！！这，这个是！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005021",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "迪迦奥特曼！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005022",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "小蓝",
          "text": "迪迦、什么迪迦？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27005023",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "啊，真的是迪迦！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-587",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "aoteman",
          "rowIds": [
            27005001,
            27005002,
