          ],
          "sectionId": 27005
        }
      ],
      "title": "寻找光明·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27006001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小蓝",
          "text": "主人，快来看奥特曼！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "是真的，活生生的迪迦，出现在我们面前了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小蓝",
          "text": "咦，不过他好像是黑色的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "黑色的迪迦代表什么呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "邪恶、黑暗、混乱……阿这。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "快逃啊！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "等，等等……你们跑什么。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你们……这是什么情况？有什么奇怪的东西在追你们？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006010",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "主人，黑暗迪迦，黑暗迪迦出现了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "黑暗的迪迦，是超古代的邪恶，曾经毁灭过一个文明的可怕存在。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "变成光明的迪迦可以从强大的怪物威胁下守护人类，那么黑暗的迪迦肯定也能摧毁一切。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "虽然但是……不过也不一定只要是黑暗的迪迦，就是纯粹代表黑暗吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "优纪她们呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "啊，大姐头她们好像没来得及逃跑，糟了，她们肯定要被干掉了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不要太早下结论，我们先回去看看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主人，你来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，听到小红小蓝吵吵闹闹的话，不能不在意啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "看这情况，果然刚才小蓝小红是夸大其词了吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "没错，具体的原因，迪迦和莉可都解释完了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27006022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "事情是这样的——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-588",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
