        }
      ],
      "title": "寻找光明·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27009001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "人类，你怎么突然有空来我这。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "当然是因为太久没见艾伦兹大人，专程来拜访。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "顺便来请艾伦兹大人帮个小忙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管理员A",
          "text": "这个人类，还真是可怕。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管理员B",
          "text": "花言巧语，张口就来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管理员C",
          "text": "艾伦兹大人完全被忽悠住了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "你们几个在背后嘀咕什么呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管理员A",
          "text": "没什么，我们在说艾伦兹大人英明神武。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "理所当然的事情就没必要特别拿出来说了，人类，说吧，你想让吾帮你什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009010",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "主人转述了迪迦遇到的困境。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "事情就是这样了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "原来如此，你想要重新找到光明的力量，向我寻求帮助？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "艾伦兹明白我们的意思吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "吾，吾当然明白了，哼，不就是迪迦奥特曼的东西吗，吾最懂了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "你来找我帮忙，算你找对人了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "不用向吾道谢，吾是看在这个人类的份上决定帮忙的，要谢你就去感谢他好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那么艾伦兹大人打算怎么做呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "这个……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "既然是这么重要的事情，有必要先开个会讨论一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27009023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "阿斯塔罗斯，你们都给我过来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
